Subject: [PATCH 3/8] fix(content): format article dates in UTC so build
 timezone cannot shift them

pubDate/updatedDate are date-only YAML values (UTC midnight). toLocaleDateString used
the build machine's timezone, so a build with TZ west of UTC rendered the previous day
(e.g. 'datetime=2026-10-15' shown as '14 Oktober 2026'; reproduced with
TZ=America/Los_Angeles). Also ArticleCard now uses ui.locale instead of a literal.
---
